abstract: "NexRoute is a modular Python and TraCI/SUMO platform for multi-agent urban traffic optimization, featuring Particle Swarm Optimization (PSO) signal timing, Variable Speed Limits (VSL), adaptive dynamic rerouting, scenario generators, and automated ablation experiment sweep orchestration."
keywords:
  - "traffic optimization"
  - "particle swarm optimization"
  - "sumo"
  - "ablation study"
  - "intelligent transportation systems"
